## Dual-DB edit checklist

If changing investment persistence or analytics: update **both** MySQL and Mongo paths (store pair, or analytics.js branch + mongo-analytics, or banking `mysqlX`/`mongoX` pair + `impl()` export).

If adding a new bank category: add to `DEFAULT_BANK_CATEGORIES` (`banking.models.ts`) and, if auto-detected, `CATEGORY_RULES`/`suggestCategory` in `common.js`.

## Reply style

Cite paths; don't paste whole files. Don't restate this map in answers. No unsolicited README/docs.
